 83→                    <button className="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all cursor-pointer outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-1">
 84→                      {initials}
